cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ArchytasZX: a qufinite ZX-calculus engine with symbolic qudit count and dimension"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dmitriev
    given-names: Arkhip Alekseyevich
repository-code: "https://github.com/Arhip-Dmitriev/ArchytasZX"
url: "https://github.com/Arhip-Dmitriev/ArchytasZX"
abstract: >-
  A qufinite ZX-calculus engine for reasoning about quantum states with support
  for symbolic qudit count and dimension. Supports diagram rewriting with bang
  boxes and per-port dimensions, an exact scalar accumulator, symbolic and
  numeric contraction oracles, proof by induction over a symbolic multiplicity,
  and replayable certificates.
keywords:
  - zx-calculus
  - qufinite
  - qudit
  - quantum computing
  - symbolic algebra
  - graph rewriting
  - quantum algorithms
  - symbolic quantum
  - graphical calculus
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.9.1
